 formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T10:29:38-07:00","id":881955,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/881131-why-can-t-lunars-use-martial-arts-in-animal-form?p=881899#post881899\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Likewise, no one really doubts that White Reaper Style is still a Lunar invention.</div> </div> </div> </div>Right here.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T12:20:20-07:00","id":882080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/881131-why-can-t-lunars-use-martial-arts-in-animal-form?p=881955#post881955\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Right here.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, total coincidence that it was first released in the Glories: Luna book.<br /> <br /> You want to assume that Crystal Chameleon wasn't designed by a Sidereal, next?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>formerly Tornado Wolf, formerly Inugami","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/636-sunder-the-gold","name":"Sunder the Gold","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar636_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5515"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T13:33:06-07:00","id":882177,"title":"","content":"I'm actually okay with this:<br /> <br /> &quot;Master, you told me the anathema was a master of Crane Style.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Mmhm.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Master, the anathema is currently a <i>crane</i>.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Mmhm.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;*angrish*&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm also okay with this:<br /> <br /> A Solar Crane Style Master ends up with a Lunar and Alchemical student.<br /> <br /> &quot;My students, you must become like the crane.&quot;<br /> <br /> Later on....<br /> <br /> Lunar: Okay.<br /> <br /> Alchemical: Done.<br /> <br /> &quot;Okay, <a href=\"http://7-themes.com/7026221-sandhill-crane-bird-water.html\" target=\"_blank\">that</a> is not what I meant and <a href=\"http://www.manitowoccranes.com/~/media/Images/products/grove/Telescoping%20Crawler%20Cranes/GHC55/GHC55_COB_PNG.png?h=702&amp;la=en&amp;w=1000\" target=\"_blank\">THAT</a> is even <i>less</i> what I meant.&quot;","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1252-god_of_awesome","name":"God_of_Awesome","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1252_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"570"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T14:28:07-07:00","id":882239,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Sunder the Gold</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/881131-why-can-t-lunars-use-martial-arts-in-animal-form?p=882080#post882080\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, total coincidence that it was first released in the Glories: Luna book.<br /> <br /> You want to assume that Crystal Chameleon wasn't designed by a Sidereal, next?</div> </div> </div> </div> \u200bI find the question of who first practiced White Reaper, or almost any other Style, to be largely irrelevant, and occasionally even an issue when people attach a lot of baggage to Martial Arts expectations based on it. I find this is enabled when the Styles, as they currently stand, do not make any such statement one way or the other. I would contrast this against the written Styles that actually <i>do</i> reference their originators.<br /> <br /> Besides, if we're taking origins given for Styles in prior Editions as gospel, does that mean people assume that Righteous Devil is practiced by one person in the entire world?<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-05-04T16:16:05-07:00","id":882328,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Isator Levi</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/lunar-exalted/881131-why-can-t-lunars-use-martial-arts-in-animal-form?p=881604#post881604\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That makes me wonder; in a version of Exalted in which everybody is an anthropomorphic animal (which y'know... do that if playing anthropomorphic animals is such a big deal), what would the place of Lunars be?</div> </div> </div> </div>Their base appearance of being bestial and weird becomes far less of an issue, as they stand out marginally less in a setting populated entirely by anthropomorphic animals, but I don't really think their place would be any different. Being the perpetually adaptable, nigh flawlessly malleable, still very much proves useful. Strictly going from a &quot;specific animal as race&quot; standpoint, I kind of point to Jade/Iron Claw, a series of Anthro RPGs where animal/race still sets some measure of standing in the setting (Dragons and Phoenixes being part of the Celestial Bureaucracy). A panther person who can shape shift into a Phoenix to infiltrate a Phoenix city is no less impressive than an Ice-Walker who can shapeshift into an Imperial to blend in on the Blessed Isle.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":882,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","user":"SamuraiMujuru","date":".  Marginally better example 05-04-2016, 07:23 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}